    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 53, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 This Maraku Werewolf Chief was once the ally of the Urutu Orcs and peacefully coexisted with them. Then he suddenly attacked the Urutu Tribe while its power was weakened, inflicting a serious blow. He and his Werewolves are now in engaged in an all-out attempt to conquer the Immortal Plateau, ancestral home to Orcs. Humanoids Lv. 6 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Humanoids. Atk. Spd. +2.5% Accuracy +3 Evasion +2 P. Def. -5% Received Critical Damage +5% Resistance to Bleed -10% Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
